<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1135_3669.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unnser freündtlich <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">willgi</unclear> diennst zuvor,
<lb n="2"/>ersamen unnd weisen besonders lieben und
<lb n="3"/>guoten <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">freünd</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Welchermaßen</unclear> unser
<lb n="4"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">lieber</unclear> mitburger, <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Hanns</unclear> Jacob <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Cunzer</unclear></persName>, an
<lb n="5"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unß</unclear> notwendig <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vohmüegenlicher</unclear> weiß
<lb n="6"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">suppliciert</unclear>, unnd umb <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fürschrift</unclear> auf E. W.
<lb n="7"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gebeten</unclear>, das habenn <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sie</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hiebeiverwart</unclear>
<lb n="8"/>nach <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lengs</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuvernemen</unclear>. Dieweil unnß
<lb n="9"/>dann <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">souil</unclear> unnd genuegsamb <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bewüßt</unclear>, das
<lb n="10"/>er unser burger, laut <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">siner</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">supplicationen</unclear>,
<lb n="11"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">diser</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">siner</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">außstenden</unclear> summa gelts, zum
<lb n="12"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hochstenn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">notürftig</unclear>, und wir auch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sini</unclear>
<lb n="13"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erbotten</unclear>, der, nach laut <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beiverwarter</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">copi</unclear>
<lb n="14"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eingeschloßen</unclear>, und in <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sollichen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fällenn</unclear> ge=
<lb n="15"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">brüchigen</unclear> quittung, und schadloß ver=
<lb n="16"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schreibung</unclear>, anderst nit, dann für genueg=
<lb n="17"/>samb achten unnd halten. So haben
<lb n="18"/>wir <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">daheer</unclear>, auch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuegethanner</unclear> burgerlicher
<lb n="19"/>verwanndtnuß halb, ime <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unserm</unclear> burger
<lb n="20"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gebettne</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fürschrift</unclear>, nit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verwegern</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mögenn</unclear>.
<lb n="21"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Lanngt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">derhalben</unclear> unnd hierauf an E. E. W.
<lb n="22"/>unser <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gannz</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freünndtlich</unclear> ersuechen und bitt,
<lb n="23"/>sie wöllenn <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ire</unclear> burger die <orgName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Zolickhofern</unclear></orgName>, so
<lb n="24"/>hierinn verwandt, dahin weisen und an=
<lb n="25"/>halten, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">merangeregtem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unserem</unclear> burger
<lb n="26"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sin</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">außstend</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">houbtgueth</unclear>, uf <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">anerbottne</unclear>
<lb n="27"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gnüegsambs</unclear> quittung, und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">schadloßver=</unclear>
<lb n="28"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">schreibung</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">abzelösen</unclear>, allß ime oder den <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ienigen</unclear>,
<lb n="29"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">denn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ers</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">überweisen</unclear> wirt, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fürderlich</unclear>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1135_3670.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="30"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zubezalen</unclear>, unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ine</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">damit</unclear>, zu seinem
<lb n="31"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">darauß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">stenden</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schaden</unclear> unnd nachtail
<lb n="32"/>nit lenger <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">aufzuhalten</unclear>, dieweil
<lb n="33"/>doch der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verlohrenn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hauptbrief</unclear> (wa der
<lb n="34"/>gleich, über <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kurtz</unclear> oder lanng wider her
<lb n="35"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">funnden</unclear> und an tag khommen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">solte</unclear>) durch
