<lb n="40"/>von dem unsern, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">in</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seiner</unclear> supplication
<lb n="41"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fürgewenndten</unclear> ursachen, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sie</unclear> sich der ab-
<lb n="42"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">losung</unclear>, umb sovil desto weniger, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mit</unclear>
<lb n="43"/>fuogen lenger nit zuerwideren habenn,
<lb n="44"/>wie wir dann <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gantz</unclear> in <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kainen</unclear> zweifel
